[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7741.91, "timestamp": "02:09:01", "text": "你好。所以，等等，等等，等等，等等。你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7752.55, "timestamp": "02:09:12", "text": "呃，CC V。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7754.47, "timestamp": "02:09:14", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7759.189, "timestamp": "02:09:19", "text": "CC V 是什么意思？我认为CC是呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7761.189, "timestamp": "02:09:21", "text": "是的。是的。用西班牙语。伏普尔。我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7763.99, "timestamp": "02:09:23", "text": "这是法语里的“fuck”的意思。我忘了那是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7765.229, "timestamp": "02:09:25", "text": "它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7766.75, "timestamp": "02:09:26", "text": "五、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7775.91, "timestamp": "02:09:35", "text": "哇。你知道，就是为了朋友之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7778.629, "timestamp": "02:09:38", "text": "该死。哦，我好像不知道似的。有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7780.709, "timestamp": "02:09:40", "text": "像这样，我不知道。对我来说，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7782.229, "timestamp": "02:09:42", "text": "我觉得我对……非常着迷"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7784.87, "timestamp": "02:09:44", "text": "欧洲的东西。所以，我就想，“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7789.189, "timestamp": "02:09:49", "text": "该死。”就像法语、西班牙语，呃，波兰语，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7790.95, "timestamp": "02:09:50", "text": "德语。感觉就像，“哦，他们听起来真……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7793.069, "timestamp": "02:09:53", "text": "“很高级。”于是我就说，“是啊，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7795.189, "timestamp": "02:09:55", "text": "可能想吧。”就像你们所有人一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7797.83, "timestamp": "02:09:57", "text": "就像你用日语一样，我用……"}]